      "summary": "Promotional Announcement Banner - PWA Kit",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, I want to see a promotional announcement banner, so that I am informed of current promotions, offers, or announcements as I browse the site.\nThis story covers the PWA Kit component build for the promotional announcement banner. Banner content, configuration, targeting, and scheduling are managed in Contentful (SFCC-111). The component can be built with mock content prior to the Contentful content model being finalised.\nThe banner is a thin full-width bar that renders above the global header on all devices. It supports single and multiple rotating messages, each with optional CTA links. Visibility is configurable per page, per storefront, and per customer group via Contentful.\nUI Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=2086-52954&p=f&t=3x1edbksiBW9FpCX-0\n \nReference image (Figma is leading):\nOne Message:\nMultiple Messages:\nKey behaviours:\nSupports single or multiple rotating messages — each message displays for a configurable duration before rotating to the next\nEach message can include text and an optional CTA link\nA close (×) icon dismisses the entire banner for the session — all messages are closed, not just the visible one\nBanner position sits above the navigation — configurable positioning descoped for now\nBanner can be targeted to specific pages, storefronts, customer groups",
